{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46891","headline":"庭际新移松竹 · 齐己","name":"庭际新移松竹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三茎瘦竹两株松，瑟瑟翛翛韵且同。\n抱节乍离新涧雪，盘根远别旧林风。\n岁寒相倚无尘地，荫影分明有月中。\n更待阳和信催促，碧梢青杪看凌空。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46891.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46891","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}